Works for me, {auditor_name}. I'll send a meeting invite for {meeting_day} at {meeting_time}.

Team - let's plan to have everything uploaded to the audit SharePoint folder by Wednesday so I can do a quick review before we meet with {auditor_name}.

{controller_name}

